{
  "info": {
    "name": "05-Admin-Soporte",
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
    "description": "Ascenso de un usuario al rol SOPORTE (solo ADMIN).\n- POST /api/admin/soporte con token ADMIN -> 200 (usuario@test.com pasa a SOPORTE).\n- Email inexistente -> 404.\n- Con token de un usuario sin rol ADMIN -> 403.\n\nNOTA: ejecutar ESTA coleccion DESPUES de la 06-Casos-Negativos, porque el ascenso convierte al\nusuario@test.com de USUARIO a SOPORTE y ya no podria usarse para probar el 403.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Ascender usuario@test.com a SOPORTE (admin) -> 200",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{ \"email\": \"usuario@test.com\" }"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/soporte"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Ascender a SOPORTE -> 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Mensaje confirma el ascenso', function () {",
              "    const body = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(body.mensaje).to.include('usuario@test.com');",
              "    pm.expect(body.mensaje).to.include('SOPORTE');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ascender email inexistente -> 404",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{ \"email\": \"noexiste@test.com\" }"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/soporte"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Email inexistente -> 404', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ascender con token de USUARIO -> 403",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{tokenCliente}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{ \"email\": \"soporte@test.com\" }"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/soporte"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('USUARIO no puede ascender -> 403', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}